Changes made by ModelANT: onnxruntime_genai.models.builder exports the model to ONNX for the CPU
execution provider and quantizes its weights to int4, and re-saves the tokenizer and its chat
template through transformers for GenAI. See scripts/export_genai.py in ModelANT.
